270	    /**
271	     * Handles {@link DuplicateOwnerIdentityException} raised when an owner request would create an
272	     * owner whose whole derived identity key (normalized telephone, email and household id) already
273	     * belongs to an existing owner. This is the single duplicate check: telephone, email and
274	     * household are no longer detected independently but only through the combined key. Returns a
275	     * 409 Conflict whose {@code errors} array names the {@code identityKey} field.
276	     *
277	     * @param e The {@link DuplicateOwnerIdentityException} to be handled
278	     * @param request {@link HttpServletRequest} object referring to the current request.
279	     * @return A {@link ResponseEntity} containing the error information and a 409 Conflict status.
280	     */
